<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT-Fraser says buy Thakral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fraser says buy Thakral.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Securities has recommended a buy on electronics consumer goods distributor Thakral Corp.</p>
<p>Fraser said in a note on Thursday that Thakral, at its current share price of US$0.73, was trading at a low prospective price earnings ratio of 8.4 times based on projected earnings for the financial year ending March 1997.</p>
</text>
